/-!
# The thin diagram `LPF1`

[mild] figure 3.2 (first diagram, LPF with an extra arrow `ε` out of `x₀`, `n ≥ 3`): `A = x₀` with `ε, a₁, ρ`; the square `a₁ ≫ μ₁ = ρ ≫ ρ`; `B = x₀ → D = x₁ → E = x₂` by `a₁, a₂`; `G = x₁ → F = x₂ → B` by `a₂, μ₂` with `μ₂ ≫ a₁ = 0`.

